:''For other uses, see [[Zeus (disambiguation)|Zeus]].''
'''Black Zeus''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 466
|rarity = LR
|name1 = Black Zeus
|name2 = Dark Lord Zeus
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Dark Lord Zeus''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Against [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies, Dark Lord Zeus is an absolute force to be reckoned with. Dealing a tremendous 22,368 DPS or 212,500 DPH against his niche at level 30, there are very few Traitless enemies that can withstand a handful of his attacks. That would be good enough on its own, but he also engages enemies at 455 range, which puts him ahead of even the likes of [[THE SLOTH]] and [[Master A.]], and his piercing range of 245 allows him to safely harm backliners like [[Camelle]] if he has a stepping stone for an effective range of 700. If enough protection is used to keep enemies out of his rather sizable blindspot, it's more than worth it for the devastation he'll leave in his path against anything without a trait.

Additionally worth noting is that, fittingly for his status as a collab unit, his anti-Traitless niche makes him a valuable unit for [[Special Events|event stages]], as a majority of [[:Category:Event Enemies|event enemies]] are Traitless. Every [[:Category:Crazed Cat Stages|Crazed Cat]] (save for [[Crazed Bird Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Bird Cat]] and its [[Manic Flying Cat (Enemy)|Manic variant]]), most Awakened Cats, and [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]] like [[King Wahwah]] and [[Doremi]] are just a few examples of enemies that will be crippled, if not ousted entirely by Black Zeus' brute power; and that's not even getting into fellow [[:Category:Collaboration Event Enemies|collab enemies]].

